u}\!\left\{x:\mathbb N	o\mathbb R: \operatorname{history}(j,0,x)\in \operatorname{affineCorridorPrefix}(j,-bL_n,0,bL_n)ight\}, \] and set \[ u_n=e^{-bL_n}\mathbb P_{
u}(G_n),\qquad w_n=e^{(-b+v)L_n}\mathbb P_{
u}(G_n),\qquad p_n=\operatorname{toReal}\!\left( rac{u_n^2}{w_n+R_n}ight), \] the module proves \[ N_n^{-b-2v-3\varepsilon}\le p_n \] eventually, where `\mathbb P_{
